  "description": "An Seo-Hae turns into a total wildcard whenever she drinks. \n\nI thought she’d definitely gotten into trouble with her old-fashioned boss, but her one-night stand turned out to be Seo Gwang-Hyeon, a friend of her older brother’s whom she’s known since childhood?! And to top it off, this promiscuous party girl is actually the CEO of our company. \n\n *“I don’t really remember. So, let’s do it again while I’m sober.”* \n\nIf anything, it’s CEO Seo Gwang-Hyeon who has all the weaknesses. \n\nI’m going to make sure I’m the one in control here!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
